lore = "The ancients built one door out of the Deep Root and one throw up to it: a stone ring by the Ascent that hurls a wake rider into the deep dark, where the wings catch the East Stack and ride the wall's own currents. It sleeps until the shard says the mystery moves -- the underworld's launcher, dormant like every other piece of the old machine (prd-mystery land)."
